<title>USA: NOTICE OF SALE - Sacramento County, Calif.</title>
<headline>NOTICE OF SALE - Sacramento County, Calif.</headline>
<text>
<p>NOTICE OF INTENTION TO SELL</p>
<p>			  Not To Exceed $12,000,000</p>
<p>			 Sacramento County Office</p>
<p>				 of Education</p>
<p>			    State of California</p>
<p>			     Anticipation Notes</p>
<p>Bids for the above-described notes will be received on the</p>
<p>official bid  form  until  9:35 a.m.,  California  time,  on</p>
<p>Wednesday,</p>
<p>  at  the  offices  of   the  District's  financial   advisor</p>
<p>Government Financial  Strategies, Inc.,  1228</p>
<p>									     St</p>
<p>Suite Thirteen, Sacramento, California 95814-5609, Telephone</p>
<p>(916) 444-5100, Telecopier (916)  444-5109. Faxed bids  will</p>
<p>be accepted. The official bid form, official notice of  sale</p>
<p>and official statement may  be obtained from the  District's</p>
<p>Financial Advisor.</p>
<p>			  (From The Bond Buyer)</p>
</text>
